WEBVTT

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.790
Don't stop moving your hands!

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.790
If you slack, we won't meet 
our quota for the day!

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.450
What's going on?

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.680
Be careful.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:38.700
S-Sorry.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.890
And you don't need to 
do anything but work.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.840
Now get back to work.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.060
S-Sorry.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.610
He didn't need to get so mad.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:55.610
He's always upset, that factory manager.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:56.830
I hate him.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.910
But we didn't have to
stay late, so it's all good.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:01.010
Right.

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:03.660
Why don't we all go bowling today?

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.330
Good idea, let's go.

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:08.790
Yoshitsugu.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.500
Y-Yes?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.820
Bye.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.600
Bye!

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.800
See you later.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.000
Goodbye.

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.070
I'm gonna win today.

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:24.230
I want to get a strike this time.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.000
It's been a while since we've played.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:21.010
Oh nice, they're not out 
of white bread today.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:21.880
Give me that.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.770
Thank you.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.650
Welcome.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:30.140
Um... the black bread.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.190
Will it be here today?

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.250
I didn't find it today, either.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.820
I'm back...

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.910
Let's eat.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.400
Blackie.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.180
Here you go.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:56.600
Everyone went bowling after work today.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.150
I wanted to say, "I want to go, too,"

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.990
but I didn't want to bother them,

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.380
so I couldn't say that.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.390
Maybe I will next time.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.200
Yeah, I will.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.730
Good luck is like this;

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.580
if you believe it's there, it's there.

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:49.070
That's how it works.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.480
Angel...

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:20.940
Good morning, Blanca.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.460
There it is!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:48.600
<i>You can find good luck if you believe!</i>

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:50.970
<i>Angel...</i>

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:04.730
Wait!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:12.620
Hey!

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.230
What are you doing?

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:17.580
The line stopped!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.190
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:20.160
I apologize.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.820
What's wrong with you?

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:24.010
We won't make our quota like this!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.530
What are you thinking?

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.920
You're always like this!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:35.760
He never gets that mad when 
somebody else screws up.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:36.930
Not her fault.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:40.000
She just looks like she has bad luck.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.160
Yeah.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.420
It's like she just 
invites bad luck on herself.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:54.300
I want to go bowling, too...

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.640
And here I'd thought I'd found luck...

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:06.760
<i>Dear Angel, you always 
told me, didn't you?</i>

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.910
<i>"Believe in good luck and you'll find it."</i>

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:16.270
<i>I've never forgotten those words.</i>

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.930
<i>And today, I finally 
found a four-leaf clover.</i>

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:24.790
<i>Words cannot describe how I felt then.</i>

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:29.200
<i>But it looks like that's 
where my luck ran out.</i>

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:33.240
<i>In the end, bad luck 
will never leave me.</i>

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:36.290
<i>Will you still tell me this?</i>

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:39.290
<i>"No, if you believe, it will come."</i>

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:43.810
<i>Perhaps I'm better suited to 
bad luck, rather than good luck.</i>

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:49.360
<i>There's no point in me having this, 
so I'll give it to you.</i>

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:51.990
<i>Heaven's Hill,</i>

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.300
<i>Angel.</i>

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:02.270
<i>A letter to you in heaven.</i>

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.750
<i>A letter that'll never be received.</i>

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.580
<i>I simply no longer need 
to hope for anything.</i>

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.050
<i>That way, bad luck will 
no longer disappoint me.</i>

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:26.220
<i>It'll just be normal.</i>

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:06.750
"Dear Yoshitsugu, 
thank you for your letter."

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.580
<i>Maybe that's a strange thing to say.</i>

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.440
<i>Hello, and nice to meet you.</i>

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.000
<i>I read your letter.</i>

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.530
<i>Don't say that you're better suited</i>

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:20.630
<i>to bad luck rather than good, 
when you were lucky enough</i>

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.780
<i>to find a four-leaf clover.</i>

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:26.290
<i>This is what I think.</i>

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.750
<i>Even as I wrote this letter,</i>

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:38.860
<i>I knocked over my cafe au lait 
and knocked over my books.</i>

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.970
<i>And when I bent down to pick them up,</i>

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:48.390
<i>I found the earring I thought 
I'd lost under the desk.</i>

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:55.780
<i>This is random good luck.</i>

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.330
<i>In other words,</i>

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:01.090
<i>when you wrote a letter to 
me about your unhappiness,</i>

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:04.340
<i>I ended up sending you a letter back.</i>

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.340
<i>Isn't that random good luck, as well?</i>

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:12.770
<i>I've enclosed an avocado seed 
as thanks for the clover.</i>

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.460
<i>"Why," you might ask?</i>

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.960
<i>I'll tell you next time.</i>

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:22.260
<i>I'll be awaiting your reply.</i>

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.510
<i>Angel, thanks for your letter.</i>

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:31.020
<i>Today, the road I normally 
take was shut down,</i>

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.940
<i>so I took a different route.</i>

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.270
<i>And then...</i>

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:37.770
<i>I happened upon a small chocolate shop.</i>

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.530
<i>When I went inside the 
shop, it smelled so good,</i>

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:45.530
<i>and there were all kinds of little 
chocolates that looked like jewels...</i>

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.990
<i>I didn't know which to get,</i>

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.190
<i>but I bought a good number.</i>

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.980
<i>Is this random good luck, too?</i>

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.040
<i>I've included some chocolate with this.</i>

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:57.650
<i>I'm praying it doesn't get crushed.</i>

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:01.300
<i>By the way, what does 
that avocado seed mean?</i>

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:03.510
<i>I'm waiting for your letter.</i>

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.430
<i>Yoshitsugu, listen to this:</i>

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:16.860
<i>I found a movie ticket that had 
almost expired in my wallet,</i>

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.130
<i>so I went to see it.</i>

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:23.830
<i>However, they were showing a love story</i>

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:27.330
<i>even sweeter than the 
chocolate you sent me.</i>

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:29.620
<i>But, this month it's a horror movie...</i>

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:33.320
<i>I really don't like horror movies.</i>

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.080
<i>But since I didn't want 
to waste my ticket,</i>

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.040
<i>I worked up my courage and</i>

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.410
<i>pushed open the door to the theater.</i>

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.090
<i>I regretted it almost immediately.</i>

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:54.600
<i>As soon as the movie started, 
my heart started pounding...</i>

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:58.460
<i>And the instant I thought I 
couldn't take it anymore...</i>

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:08.570
<i>That's right, the film burned up 
during the scariest scene.</i>

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.520
<i>What? Now?</i>

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:14.480
<i>I just started laughing.</i>

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:21.180
<i>So in my mind, "The Scariest 
Wolfman in History"</i>

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.830
<i>is now a comedy.</i>

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.590
<i>More random good luck!</i>

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:31.190
<i>If you raise an avocado seed, 
it ends up looking like this.</i>

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.230
<i>Angel.</i>

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.700
<i>Thank you for your letter.</i>

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:42.240
<i>They aren't showing that movie here yet.</i>

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.910
<i>I don't like horror movies either,</i>

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.610
<i>but I want to see the scene 
where it turned into a comedy,</i>

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.780
<i>so maybe I'll go see it when it starts.</i>

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:54.510
<i>I planted your avocado seed.</i>

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.050
<i>I can't wait for it to grow.</i>

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:02.080
<i>I've put a bookmark I made in this 
letter as thanks for the seed.</i>

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.550
<i>If you like, please use it.</i>

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:10.130
<i>Yoshitsugu, thanks for
the fantastic bookmark.</i>

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:12.640
<i>I didn't have any pretty books</i>

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.020
<i>that I could put your bookmark in,</i>

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.800
<i>so I went to the bookstore.</i>

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.730
<i>That's where I found this pretty book.</i>

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:26.880
<i>I thought it would look 
good with your bookmark,</i>

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.790
<i>but the contents are good, too!</i>

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:34.030
<i>And so I decided to buy 
another and send it to you.</i>

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.530
<i>With wishes for random good luck...</i>

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:44.670
<i>Angel, may I come see you?</i>

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.770
<i>If it's a problem, please refuse.</i>

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.590
<i>Yoshitsugu,</i>

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.310
<i>it's not a problem at all.</i>

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.430
<i>Please come and see me.</i>

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.390
<i>I'll be waiting eagerly.</i>

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:04.150
I wonder what Heaven's Hill is like.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:09.780
I'm sure it's a beautiful and 
wonderful town, unlike here.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:25.670
<i>I wonder what Angel's like.</i>

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.790
<i>I'm sure they're wonderful...</i>

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:48.030
<i>Angel, I finally saved up the money.</i>

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.860
<i>I also got the day off,</i>

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.650
<i>so I can finally come to Heaven's Hill.</i>

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.770
E-Excuse me, are you okay?

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.080
My chest...

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.040
I'll get you to a hospital.

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:07.520
<i>We've spoken so much in our letters,</i>

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:10.400
<i>but there's so much I want 
to say to you in person!</i>

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.490
<i>I don't know how long it will take...</i>

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:17.220
<i>I can't wait.</i>

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:22.140
Excuse me.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.310
The plane ticket I reserved...

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.370
I'm sorry.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:27.980
We're closed for the day.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.190
Please, I need to get it today!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.590
One moment, please.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.370
It's 923 Euros.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:40.920
Right.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:43.890
Huh?

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:46.460
What's wrong?

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.230
My money...

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.340
You don't have it?

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.380
Yes.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.640
<i>Angel, I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.770
<i>I'm no longer able to make it.</i>

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:07.770
<i>I was so looking forward to it,</i>

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.870
<i>but I lost my money...</i>

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:21.560
<i>And this bad luck never turned 
into random good luck...</i>

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.350
Why?!

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:50.740
Why, Angel?!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:55.840
Why won't you write me back?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:02.010
Postman!

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:11.500
<i>Yoshitsugu, I'm sorry I couldn't 
write to you for so long.</i>

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:15.830
<i>So much has happened 
since you sent me</i>

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.700
<i>that letter saying you couldn't come.</i>

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.510
<i>I'm really sorry.</i>

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.650
<i>I know this doesn't make up for it,</i>

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:24.540
<i>but I'm sending a plane ticket.</i>

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:28.210
<i>I really want to see you.</i>

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:32.020
<i>And there's so much I want... 
so much I need to talk to you about.</i>

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:35.610
<i>Anyway, please come right away.</i>

00:19:36.180 --> 00:19:37.680
<i>I'll be waiting.</i>

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.440
This is Heaven's Hill?

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.740
Hey, nobody lives there!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:03.800
Excuse me, does anyone 
named Angel live here?

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:07.130
You're here to see Angel?

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.200
That girl...

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.680
I'm so glad you came.

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:19.230
None of her friends came,
to take her things.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.820
I've just left them here.

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:25.420
She was working so hard for 
the past six months...

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:28.870
What she needed the 
money for, I don't know.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:31.550
The doctors said it was overwork.

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:35.070
She never was very strong.

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:38.130
Anyway, pack up her 
things and take them.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.880
"When I think about seeing you soon,

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.580
I'm so happy, I can't sleep."

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:56.290
<i>Actually, I have something 
I have to tell you.</i>

00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:00.820
<i>When I see you, I may 
not be able to say it.</i>

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.400
<i>So I'm going to put it in this letter.</i>

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:08.750
<i>The day your first letter came,</i>

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:12.040
<i>I was planning on killing myself.</i>

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:16.210
<i>But when I read your letter,</i>

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:19.540
<i>I told myself I had to write back.</i>

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:26.480
<i>Yoshitsugu, I cheered you up,</i>

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:30.810
<i>but really, you cheered me up.</i>

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:32.780
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:38.160
<i>That was the best random 
good luck I could have hoped for.</i>

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:42.050
<i>I hope we can be friends for a long time.</i>

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:45.280
<i>I'm sure we will be...</i>

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:51.110
I'm sure we will be...

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:53.910
best friends forever.

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:04.920
Angel...

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.510
Next time it's the Vengeful Fang,

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:50.700
Akechi Mitsuhide-san.

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:55.490
Next time on Sengoku Collection: 
"Vengeful Fang, IS."

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.830
I hope it's a happy story...
